  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Coalition for Epidemic Preparedness Innovations &#x2013; CEPI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEPI is an innovative global partnership between public, private, philanthropic, and civil society organisations which works with numerous partners across the academic and industry spectrum, and with organisations across the world to accelerate the development of safe and effective vaccines against major emerging infectious diseases and enable equitable access to these vaccines for people in LMICs during outbreaks. This contribution is earmarked for activities that were agreed as being fully ODA-eligible as part of the decision made by the OECD DAC in March 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
